      "message": "fix(post): keep Doosan DNM G5.1 out of an open canned-cycle group\n\nThe hole chain of a canned cycle reaches onLinear. The post armed AICC\nsmoothing (G5.1 Q1) before chainCut() dropped the move, so each hole\nwrote G5.1 Q1 and G5.1 Q0 while G81-G89 was modal. The section end also\nwrote G5.1 Q0 before G80. A Fanuc 0i-F alarms on these words.\n\nonLinear and onCircular now arm smoothing only outside a cycle group.\nendPreamble writes G80 before G5.1 Q0.\n\nPinned by doosan_dnm_smoothing_stays_out_of_open_cycle_group.\n\nFixes #4347\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
